    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d242">

                <pb facs="0320" n="204" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg204"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 839.51/1215.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Minister Sullivan.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-02-03T19:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 3, 1914, 7 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your February 1, 3 p.m. Insular Bureau believes Vick will be able to provide five
                    thousand dollars daily.</p>
                <p>Department desires commercial attaché to be in effect a financial expert and
                    virtual comptroller, but gives him title and attachés him <pb facs="0321"
                        n="205" xml:id="pg205"/> to Legation in deference to Dominican
                    susceptibilities. Department intended its January 26, 3 p.m. to embrace
                    necessary powers, but if you think additional powers important cable what they
                    are.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
